"نسبة الأراضي المتدهورة من إجمالي مساحة الأراضي؛"

# Requires manual validation; translated with DeepL
#: ../../introduction.md:288
msgid ""
"The [Addendum to Version 2 of the Good Practice Guidance for SDG "
"Indicator 15.3.1](https://www.unccd.int/resources/manuals-and-guides"
"/addendum-good-practice-guidance-sdg-indicator-1531-proportion-land);"
